      "administering_agency": "Nevada County Community Development Agency, Planning Department",
      "funding_type": "other",
      "typical_award_size": "Draft 7th Cycle Housing Element released for 30-day review October 5, 2026 and directed to HCD on October 20, 2026. RHNA 3,712 units (1,703 lower, 730 moderate, 1,279 above moderate). Site inventory shows a 677-unit lower income shortfall, so the County must rezone about 42 acres to the RH (Residential High) zone at a minimum 16 units per acre by May 15, 2030 (if adopted and certified within 120 days of the May 15, 2027 deadline). Candidate sites are near community regions and rural centers with services.",
